# Density Compare
# Neptunium (Np) — real density 20.45 g/cm³. equal masses: Neptunium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Neptunium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.3mm color: #00d0ff at (-20mm, 3.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 163.1 g — the water cube is the reference
